# 2. NO PRE-CREATION EMAIL VERIFICATION

Do NOT implement:

```text
Enter email
   ↓
Verify email
   ↓
OTP
   ↓
Create Driver
```

That previous approach is no longer required.

The correct flow is:

```text
Enter Driver details
   ↓
Create Driver
   ↓
Email verification
   ↓
Driver login
```

This matches the traditional Customer-style account creation architecture.

